alterations.description:
Considerably the scenes of indecorous dancing, levity, revelry and drunken brawls appearing in the background of the main titles and continuing thereafter; particularly delete — (a) shots of a female dancer lifting up her legs, exposing her thighs and turning indecorously on the table
(b) two men lifting and carrying a female dancer lustily on their arms (c) a man holding her in embrace against the table and kissing her passionately;
and (d) a man and woman making love under a table
